{"sha": "4f0783699192e51eb6ecce64197db222a684516c79b626005456fd20bcc4ff77", "body": ["\\medskip", "\\noindent\\textbf{第六部分 --- 同族核。}余切核", "有若干同族核；每个核各自为一族级数定价。", "\\begin{enumerate}[resume]", "  \\item 对第 9 题的展开式逐项求导", "        （依据", "        \\cref{thm:b3:holomorphic:weierstrassconv}），得到", "        在 $\\C\\setminus\\Z$ 的紧子集上正规收敛：", "        \\[", "        \\frac{\\pi^2}{\\sin^2(\\pi z)} =", "        \\sum_{n\\in\\Z}\\frac1{(z - n)^2} .", "        \\]", "  \\item 令 $z = \\frac12$，得：", "        $\\sum_{m\\geq0}\\frac1{(2m+1)^2} = \\frac{\\pi^2}8$;", "        按奇偶性拆分整数，再次恢复", "        $\\zeta(2)$。", "  \\item 验证倍角恒等式 $\\tan\\theta =", "        \\cot\\theta - 2\\cot(2\\theta)$，并推出", "        \\[", "        \\pi\\tan(\\pi z) =", "        \\sum_{m\\geq0}\\frac{8z}{(2m+1)^2 - 4z^2} ,", "        \\]", "        在避开 $\\frac12 + \\Z$ 的紧集上正规收敛。", "  \\item 在 $0$ 附近展开（$\\abs z < \\frac12$；", "        再次使用富比尼定理），其中 $\\lambda(s) =", "        \\sum_{m\\geq0}(2m+1)^{-s}$,", "        \\[", "        \\pi\\tan(\\pi z) =", "        \\sum_{k\\geq0}8\\cdot4^k\\,\\lambda(2k+2)\\,z^{2k+1} ;", "        \\]", "        与 $\\tan u = u + \\frac{u^3}3 + O(u^5)$ 比较，以", "        恢复 $\\lambda(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}8$，并求得", "        $\\lambda(4) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{96}$，再", "        验证 $\\zeta(4) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$：由 $\\lambda(4) = (1 -", "        2^{-4})\\,\\zeta(4)$ 可得。", "  \\item 验证 $\\frac1{\\sin\\theta} = \\cot\\frac\\theta2 -", "        \\cot\\theta$，并推出", "        \\[", "        \\frac{\\pi}{\\sin(\\pi z)} = \\frac1z +", "        \\sum_{n\\geq1}(-1)^n\\,\\frac{2z}{z^2 - n^2} .", "        \\]", "        借助", "        $\\pi/\\sin(\\pi z)$ 在整数点处的留数检验符号。", "  \\item 读出 $z$ 的系数：$\\eta(2) =", "        \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n^2} =", "        \\frac{\\pi^2}{12}$，并验证", "        一致性 $\\eta(2) = (1 - 2^{1-2})\\,\\zeta(2)$。", "  \\item （压轴）将第 20 题的展开式在 $z =", "        \\frac12$ 处求值，并推出 \\emph{莱布尼茨公式}", "        \\[", "        \\frac\\pi4 = 1 - \\frac13 + \\frac15 - \\frac17 +", "        \\cdots", "        \\]", "        以一段简短文字作结：每个核对应一种算术", "        --- 哪一个核为哪一族级数定价，", "        以及为何它们在结构上都对", "        $\\zeta(3)$ 视而不见。", "", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\medskip", "\\noindent\\textbf{第七部分 --- 完整价目表：伯努利", "数。}", "\\begin{enumerate}[resume]", "  \\item 将 $\\pi", "        z\\cot(\\pi z)$ 的部分分式展开与伯努利数的母函数相结合", "        （$\\frac{w}{\\eu^w - 1} =", "        \\sum_n\\frac{B_n}{n!}w^n$,", "        见\\cref{pb:b3:holomorphic:1}，第六部分）：由", "        \\[", "        \\pi z\\cot(\\pi z) = \\iu\\pi z +", "        \\frac{2\\iu\\pi z}{\\eu^{2\\iu\\pi z} - 1}", "        \\]", "        （先证明此恒等式），推出闭形式", "        \\[", "        \\zeta(2k) = (-1)^{k+1}\\,", "        \\frac{(2\\pi)^{2k}\\,B_{2k}}{2\\,(2k)!}", "        \\qquad (k \\geq 1).", "        \\]", "  \\item 对照 $B_2 = \\frac16$，$B_4 =", "        -\\frac1{30}$，$B_6 = \\frac1{42}$，检验公式，恢复 $\\zeta(2) =", "        \\frac{\\pi^2}6$，$\\zeta(4) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$，并", "        计算 $\\zeta(6) = \\frac{\\pi^6}{945}$。", "  \\item （欧拉递推）将", "        $\\bigl(z\\cot z\\bigr)' = \\cot z - z(1 + \\cot^2z)$ 两边展开 ---", "        或直接平方余切级数 --- 以证明", "        \\[", "        \\Bigl(k + \\frac12\\Bigr)\\zeta(2k) =", "        \\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}\\zeta(2j)\\,\\zeta(2k - 2j)", "        \\qquad (k \\geq 2),", "        \\]", "        并检验 $\\zeta(4)$ 可由 $\\zeta(2)$ 算得，", "        $\\zeta(6)$ 可由 $\\zeta(2), \\zeta(4)$ 算得 --- 全部偶数", "        阶的 zeta 值都只由单一起点 $\\frac{\\pi^2}6$ 得到，", "        无需任何新的积分。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{problem}", ""]}